WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.500
Optical study: a mechanical aperture moves through a dark copper glow.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:17.500
Sunlit study: sculptural planes slide across a circle of afternoon light.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:26.200
Refraction study: glasslike forms and ribbons of colour drift across a cool frame.
